```

\== React

```jsx
const { processing } = useForm({ ... })

<button type="submit" disabled={processing}>Submit</button>
```

\== Svelte 4|Svelte 5

```svelte
<button type="submit" disabled={$form.processing}>Submit</button>
```

:::

